[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0010","text":"……企划组合那边\n成果很出色，完成度也很高"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0020","text":"那边来问能不能续约了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0030","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0040","text":"我让他们给了考虑时间\n希望圆香你好好想清楚今后想怎么做，再做决定"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0050","text":"……我明白了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0060","text":"辛苦啦—／辛苦啦……！／辛苦啦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0070","text":"哦哦，大家\n练习辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0080","text":"这段时间人数一直不太固定……\n有没有因为安排变化觉得不方便之类的？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0090","text":"啊—，没事\n教练说了，做能做的事就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0100","text":"……那、那个……制作人……\n圆香同学，要到什么时候……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0110","text":"……小糸？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0120","text":"──诶、那个……\n如、如果企划组合继续下去的话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0130","text":"圆香同学……\n说不定会退出noctchill，对吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0140","text":"真的吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0150","text":"……让你感到不安了，很抱歉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0160","text":"但事情还没有定下来\n现在……希望大家耐心等圆香的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0170","text":"诶～？\n也就是说，连告白的答复都没听就走了啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0180","text":"应、应该是其他学校的人吧……\n而且连名字都没报，对吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0190","text":"嗯—\n好像是那样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0200","text":"……那个\n那、透同学是怎么────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_05_0014","text":"Motion"}]
